    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Turn-pause buckets, main vs subagent",
      "description": "Turns whose gap since that transcript's prior turn falls in this bucket. Validates the 5m/1h cache-TTL choice (H1): a high 5m-60m share argues for a longer TTL, a low one confirms the current default.",
